OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry with
OL,6,Fbright spells. Outbreaks of rain will
OL,7,Fhowever spread north from mid-morning,
OL,8,Fthese becoming heavy in places in the
OL,9,Feast from the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,12,Frain, heavy at times at first. The
OL,13,Frain will clear from the west from
OL,14,Fmidnight. The wind will strengthen
OL,15,Falong the coast for a time overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry and bright start will
OL,18,Fsoon be followed by outbreaks of rain
OL,19,Fspreading east, these heavy in places.
OL,20,FThe wind will strengthen from the
OL,21,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
