OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy with locally heavy showers,
OL,7,Fdrier east, Sunday. Dry and bright
OL,8,Fmorning Monday, becoming breezy with
OL,9,Frain later. Very windy with showers,
OL,10,Fmainly south and some heavy, Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
